    "returnType" : "boolean",
    "comment" : "\n     * See TS 22.030 Annex B.\n     * In temporary mode, to suppress CLIR for a single call, enter:\n     *      \" * 31 # [called number] SEND \"\n     *  In temporary mode, to invoke CLIR for a single call enter:\n     *       \" # 31 # [called number] SEND \"\n     ",
